ns, red pesto, red grapes, sun-dried tomatoes, cooked in red wine. Probably the most technically sophisticated dish he's ever prepared, with a rich juxtaposition of complementary flavours. The grapes were particularly pleasing, helping to bring out the real flavour in the sauce. It was also very aesthetically pleasant; the cooking died the outer surface of the chicken breast a nice deep purple hue (that kind of resembled the grey of tender fish portions), and also toughened it up some giving the impression and texture of a nice casing, and it also made the inner meat look even whiter by contrast once you cut into it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-28T15:05:49-07:00","id":100890,"title":"","content":"I made chilli using ground buffalo the other day. Used chipotle Tobasco sauce to give it heat and a nice smokey flavor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]