o vegetables(Except tomatoe and cooked spinach) cause ew<br /> <br /> I need some ideas in hopes something sparks my desire to eat again. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>the SMBC team did a <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/brokeeats/videos\" target=\"_blank\">broke eats</a> and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL3EC5CCA8B2F2F3F5\" target=\"_blank\">hand to mouth</a> series a few years back. They were primarily aimed to college kids or people otherwise just starting out with next to no experience in cooking and very tight budgets.<br /> <br /> for more interesting things, there's also<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/EpicMealTime\" target=\"_blank\"> Epic Meal Time</a>... they tend to the huge elaborate stuff, but mostly by virtue of size and always including bacon. the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/HowToHandleIt/videos\" target=\"_blank\">Handle It</a> videos are generally more tame","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-21T00:05:38-07:00","id":288403,"title":"","content":"Ooooh thanks i'll look that up! anything to save a dime at this point lol<br /> <br /> <br /> ______________<br /> <br /> holy crap...if ya'll here have NEVER had it...go eat this cheap crap now! Cheesy Tuna Helper. (its the orange sauce kind not the white sauce kind) Its like 1.50(plus like 70 cnets for a can of tuna) and holy crap its amazing...(though if you are lactose intolerant like myself i dont recommend eating the entire box alone like i did or your tummy may stage a rather painful revolt and cause you to break your toliet ;&gt;&gt;) <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-21T21:48:02-07:00","id":289253,"title":"","content":"Got a burrito at Chipotle today. Chicken, white rice, pinto beans, hot salsa, sour cream, lettuce. It was fine, I guess, but I got a bite at the end that didn't have any hot sauce on it, and I think I discovered that I was wrong all this time when I thought I liked Chipotle. I don't. I just like the hot sauce.<br /> <br /> Seems like there have to be cheaper and less carb-filled ways to make my lips burn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-22T07:12:04-07:00","id":289558,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/46335-the-triumphant-return-of-the-lets-talk-food-thread?p=289253#post289253\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Got a burrito at Chipotle today. Chicken, white rice, pinto beans, hot salsa, sour cream, lettuce. It was fine, I guess, but I got a bite at the end that didn't have any hot sauce on it, and I think I discovered that I was wrong all this time when I thought I liked Chipotle. I don't. I just like the hot sauce.<br /> <br /> Seems like there have to be cheaper and less carb-filled ways to make my lips burn.</div> </div> </div> </div>When I need a quick bite to eat during a grocery run, I stop at my local Kentucky Fried Taco. I was rather bewildered to discover that the KFC hot sauce is hotter than any of the Taco Bell Fire Sauces.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-22T08:20:28-07:00","id":289614,"title":"","content":"Well there's always buying your own sauces and rubs. There's a bit of a risk in there, as capsaicin is a cruel mistress.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attach